      "Provincial liquor board markups and provincial sales tax/HST are NOT included: in most provinces alcohol must be imported through or with the liquor board (LCBO, SAQ, BCLDB…), whose markup is usually larger than all federal charges combined. The result here is the federal landed cost at the border.",
